{"id":"torrey:jews-the","source":"torrey","name":"Jews, The","slug":"jews-the","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"Descended from Abraham — Isa 51:2; Joh 8:39.","refs":[["Isa",51,2,51,2],["John",8,39,8,39]]},{"text":"Divided into twelve tribes — Ge 35:22; 49:28.","refs":[["Gen",35,22,35,22],["Gen",49,28,49,28]]},{"text":"Hebrews. — Ge 14:13; 40:15; 2Co 11:22.","refs":[["Gen",14,13,14,13],["Gen",40,15,40,15],["2Cor",11,22,11,22]]},{"text":"Israelites. — Ex 9:7; Jos 3:17.","refs":[["Exod",9,7,9,7],["Josh",3,17,3,17]]},{"text":"Seed of Abraham. — Ps 105:6; Isa 41:8.","refs":[["Ps",105,6,105,6],["Isa",41,8,41,8]]},{"text":"Seed of Jacob. — Jer 33:26.","refs":[["Jer",33,26,33,26]]},{"text":"Seed of Israel. — 1Ch 16:13.","refs":[["1Chr",16,13,16,13]]},{"text":"Children of Jacob. — 1Ch 16:13.","refs":[["1Chr",16,13,16,13]]},{"text":"Children of Israel. — Ge 50:25; Isa 27:12.","refs":[["Gen",50,25,50,25],["Isa",27,12,27,12]]},{"text":"Jeshurun. — De 32:15.","refs":[["Deut",32,15,32,15]]},{"text":"Chosen and loved by God — De 7:6,7.","refs":[["Deut",7,6,7,6],["Deut",7,7,7,7]]},{"text":"Circumcised in token of their covenant relation — Ge 17:10,11; Ac 7:8.","refs":[["Gen",17,10,17,10],["Gen",17,11,17,11],["Acts",7,8,7,8]]},{"text":"Separated from all other nations — Ex 33:16; Le 20:24; 1Ki 8:53.","refs":[["Exod",33,16,33,16],["Lev",20,24,20,24],["1Kgs",8,53,8,53]]},{"text":"A peculiar people. — De 14:2.","refs":[["Deut",14,2,14,2]]},{"text":"A peculiar treasure. — Ex 19:5; Ps 135:4.","refs":[["Exod",19,5,19,5],["Ps",135,4,135,4]]},{"text":"A holy nation. — Ex 19:6.","refs":[["Exod",19,6,19,6]]},{"text":"A holy people. — De 7:6; 14:21.","refs":[["Deut",7,6,7,6],["Deut",14,21,14,21]]},{"text":"A kingdom of priests. — Ex 19:6.","refs":[["Exod",19,6,19,6]]},{"text":"A special people. — De 7:6.","refs":[["Deut",7,6,7,6]]},{"text":"The Lord’s portion. — De 32:9.","refs":[["Deut",32,9,32,9]]},{"text":"Sojourned in Egypt — Ex 12:40,41.","refs":[["Exod",12,40,12,40],["Exod",12,41,12,41]]},{"text":"Brought out of Egypt by God — Ex 12:42; De 5:15; 6:12.","refs":[["Exod",12,42,12,42],["Deut",5,15,5,15],["Deut",6,12,6,12]]},{"text":"In the desert forty years — Nu 14:33; Jos 5:6.","refs":[["Num",14,33,14,33],["Josh",5,6,5,6]]},{"text":"Settled in Canaan — Nu 32:18; Jos 14:1-5.","refs":[["Num",32,18,32,18],["Josh",14,1,14,5]]},{"text":"Under the theocracy until the time of Samuel — Ex 19:4-6; 1Sa 8:7.","refs":[["Exod",19,4,19,6],["1Sam",8,7,8,7]]},{"text":"Desired and obtained kings — 1Sa 8:5,22.","refs":[["1Sam",8,5,8,5],["1Sam",8,22,8,22]]},{"text":"Divided into two kingdoms after Solomon — 1Ki 11:31,32; 12:19,20.","refs":[["1Kgs",11,31,11,31],["1Kgs",11,32,11,32],["1Kgs",12,19,12,19],["1Kgs",12,20,12,20]]},{"text":"Often subdued and made tributary — Jdj 2:13,14; 4:2; 6:2,6; 2Ki 23:33.","refs":[["Judg",2,13,2,13],["Judg",2,14,2,14],["Judg",4,2,4,2],["Judg",6,2,6,2],["Judg",6,6,6,6],["2Kgs",23,33,23,33]]},{"text":"Taken captive to Assyria and Babylon — 2Ki 17:32; 18:11; 24:16; 25:11.","refs":[["2Kgs",17,32,17,32],["2Kgs",18,11,18,11],["2Kgs",24,16,24,16],["2Kgs",25,11,25,11]]},{"text":"Restored to their own land by Cyrus — Ezr 1:1-4.","refs":[["Ezra",1,1,1,4]]},{"text":"Had courts of justice — De 16:18.","refs":[["Deut",16,18,16,18]]},{"text":"Had an ecclesiastical establishment — Ex 28:1; Nu 18:6; Mal 2:4-7.","refs":[["Exod",28,1,28,1],["Num",18,6,18,6],["Mal",2,4,2,7]]},{"text":"Had a series of prophets to promote national reformation — Jer 7:25; 26:4,5; 35:15; 44:4; Eze 38:17.","refs":[["Jer",7,25,7,25],["Jer",26,4,26,4],["Jer",26,5,26,5],["Jer",35,15,35,15],["Jer",44,4,44,4],["Ezek",38,17,38,17]]},{"text":"The only people who had knowledge of God — Ps 76:1; 1Th 4:5; Ps 48:3; Ro 1:28.","refs":[["Ps",76,1,76,1],["1Thess",4,5,4,5],["Ps",48,3,48,3],["Rom",1,28,1,28]]},{"text":"The only people who worshipped God — Ex 5:17; Ps 96:5; 115:3,4; Joh 4:22.","refs":[["Exod",5,17,5,17],["Ps",96,5,96,5],["Ps",115,3,115,3],["Ps",115,4,115,4],["John",4,22,4,22]]},{"text":"Religion of, according to rites prescribed by God — Le 18:4; De 12:8-11; Heb 9:1.","refs":[["Lev",18,4,18,4],["Deut",12,8,12,11],["Heb",9,1,9,1]]},{"text":"Religion of, typical — Heb 9:8-11; 10:1.","refs":[["Heb",9,8,9,11],["Heb",10,1,10,1]]},{"text":"Their national greatness — Ge 12:2; De 33:29.","refs":[["Gen",12,2,12,2],["Deut",33,29,33,29]]},{"text":"Their national privileges — Ro 3:2; 9:4,5.","refs":[["Rom",3,2,3,2],["Rom",9,4,9,4],["Rom",9,5,9,5]]},{"text":"Their vast numbers — Ge 22:17; Nu 10:36.","refs":[["Gen",22,17,22,17],["Num",10,36,10,36]]},{"text":"Pride of descent, & c. — Jer 13:9; Joh 8:33,41.","refs":[["Jer",13,9,13,9],["John",8,33,8,33],["John",8,41,8,41]]},{"text":"Love of country. — Ps 137:6.","refs":[["Ps",137,6,137,6]]},{"text":"Fondness for their brethren. — Ex 2:11,12; Ro 9:1-3.","refs":[["Exod",2,11,2,11],["Exod",2,12,2,12],["Rom",9,1,9,3]]},{"text":"Attachment to Moses. — Joh 9:28,29; Ac 6:11.","refs":[["John",9,28,9,28],["John",9,29,9,29],["Acts",6,11,6,11]]},{"text":"Attachment to customs of the law. — Ac 6:14; 21:21; 22:3.","refs":[["Acts",6,14,6,14],["Acts",21,21,21,21],["Acts",22,3,22,3]]},{"text":"Fondness for traditionary customs. — Jer 44:17; Eze 20:18,30,21; Mr 7:3,4.","refs":[["Jer",44,17,44,17],["Ezek",20,18,20,18],["Ezek",20,30,20,30],["Ezek",20,21,20,21],["Mark",7,3,7,3],["Mark",7,4,7,4]]},{"text":"Stubborn and stiffnecked. — Ex 32:9; Ac 7:51.","refs":[["Exod",32,9,32,9],["Acts",7,51,7,51]]},{"text":"Prone to rebellion. — De 9:7,24; Isa 1:2.","refs":[["Deut",9,7,9,7],["Deut",9,24,9,24],["Isa",1,2,1,2]]},{"text":"Prone to backsliding. — Jer 2:11-13; 8:5.","refs":[["Jer",2,11,2,13],["Jer",8,5,8,5]]},{"text":"Prone to idolatry. — Isa 2:8; 57:5.","refs":[["Isa",2,8,2,8],["Isa",57,5,57,5]]},{"text":"Prone to formality in religion. — Isa 29:13; Eze 33:31; Mt 15:7-9.","refs":[["Isa",29,13,29,13],["Ezek",33,31,33,31],["Matt",15,7,15,9]]},{"text":"Self-righteous. — Isa 65:5; Ro 10:3.","refs":[["Isa",65,5,65,5],["Rom",10,3,10,3]]},{"text":"Unfaithful to covenant engagements. — Jer 3:6-8; 31:32; Eze 16:59.","refs":[["Jer",3,6,3,8],["Jer",31,32,31,32],["Ezek",16,59,16,59]]},{"text":"Ungrateful to God. — De 32:15; Isa 1:2.","refs":[["Deut",32,15,32,15],["Isa",1,2,1,2]]},{"text":"Ignorant of the true sense of Scripture. — Ac 13:27; 2Co 3:13-15.","refs":[["Acts",13,27,13,27],["2Cor",3,13,3,15]]},{"text":"Distrustful of God. — Nu 14:11; Ps 78:22.","refs":[["Num",14,11,14,11],["Ps",78,22,78,22]]},{"text":"Covetous. — Jer 6:13; Eze 33:31; Mic 2:2.","refs":[["Jer",6,13,6,13],["Ezek",33,31,33,31],["Mic",2,2,2,2]]},{"text":"Cowardly. — Ex 14:10; Nu 14:3; Isa 51:12.","refs":[["Exod",14,10,14,10],["Num",14,3,14,3],["Isa",51,12,51,12]]},{"text":"Trusted to their privileges for salvation — Jer 7:4; Mt 3:9.","refs":[["Jer",7,4,7,4],["Matt",3,9,3,9]]},{"text":"Distinction of castes among, noticed — Isa 65:5; Lu 7:39; 15:2; Ac 26:5.","refs":[["Isa",65,5,65,5],["Luke",7,39,7,39],["Luke",15,2,15,2],["Acts",26,5,26,5]]},{"text":"Degenerated as they increased in national greatness — Am 6:4.","refs":[["Amos",6,4,6,4]]},{"text":"Often displeased God by their sins — Nu 25:3; De 32:16; 1Ki 16:2; Isa 1:4; 5:24,25.","refs":[["Num",25,3,25,3],["Deut",32,16,32,16],["1Kgs",16,2,16,2],["Isa",1,4,1,4],["Isa",5,24,5,24],["Isa",5,25,5,25]]},{"text":"A spiritual seed of true believers always among — 1Ki 19:18; Isa 6:13; Ro 9:6,7; 11:1,5.","refs":[["1Kgs",19,18,19,18],["Isa",6,13,6,13],["Rom",9,6,9,6],["Rom",9,7,9,7],["Rom",11,1,11,1],["Rom",11,5,11,5]]},{"text":"Hebrews or pure Jews. — Ac 6:1; Php 3:5.","refs":[["Acts",6,1,6,1],["Phil",3,5,3,5]]},{"text":"Hellenists or Grecians. — Ac 6:1; 9:29.","refs":[["Acts",6,1,6,1],["Acts",9,29,9,29]]},{"text":"Many sects and parties. — Mt 16:6; Mr 8:15.","refs":[["Matt",16,6,16,6],["Mark",8,15,8,15]]},{"text":"An agricultural people — Ge 46:32.","refs":[["Gen",46,32,46,32]]},{"text":"A commercial people — Eze 27:17.","refs":[["Ezek",27,17,27,17]]},{"text":"Obliged to unite against enemies — Nu 32:20-22; Jdj 19:29; 20:1-48; 1Sa 11:7,8.","refs":[["Num",32,20,32,22],["Judg",19,29,19,29],["Judg",20,1,20,48],["1Sam",11,7,11,7],["1Sam",11,8,11,8]]},{"text":"Often distinguished in war — Jdj 7:19-23; 1Sa 14:6-13; 17:32,33; Ne 4:16-22.","refs":[["Judg",7,19,7,23],["1Sam",14,6,14,13],["1Sam",17,32,17,32],["1Sam",17,33,17,33],["Neh",4,16,4,22]]},{"text":"Strengthened by God in war — Le 26:7,8; Jos 5:13,14; 8:1,2.","refs":[["Lev",26,7,26,7],["Lev",26,8,26,8],["Josh",5,13,5,13],["Josh",5,14,5,14],["Josh",8,1,8,1],["Josh",8,2,8,2]]},{"text":"Under God’s special protection — De 32:10,11; 33:27-29; Ps 105:13-15; 121:3-5.","refs":[["Deut",32,10,32,10],["Deut",32,11,32,11],["Deut",33,27,33,29],["Ps",105,13,105,15],["Ps",121,3,121,5]]},{"text":"Enemies of, obliged to acknowledge them as divinely protected — Jos 2:9-11; Es 6:13.","refs":[["Josh",2,9,2,11],["Esth",6,13,6,13]]},{"text":"Associating with others. — Ac 10:28.","refs":[["Acts",10,28,10,28]]},{"text":"Covenanting with others. — Ex 23:32; De 7:2.","refs":[["Exod",23,32,23,32],["Deut",7,2,7,2]]},{"text":"Marry with others. — De 7:3; Jos 23:12.","refs":[["Deut",7,3,7,3],["Josh",23,12,23,12]]},{"text":"Following practices of others. — De 12:29-31; 18:9-14.","refs":[["Deut",12,29,12,31],["Deut",18,9,18,14]]},{"text":"Despised all strangers — 1Sa 17:36; Mt 16:26,27; Eph 2:11.","refs":[["1Sam",17,36,17,36],["Matt",16,26,16,26],["Matt",16,27,16,27],["Eph",2,11,2,11]]},{"text":"Held no intercourse with strangers — Joh 4:9; Ac 11:2,3.","refs":[["John",4,9,4,9],["Acts",11,2,11,2],["Acts",11,3,11,3]]},{"text":"Condemned for associating with other nations — Jdj 2:1-3; Jer 2:18.","refs":[["Judg",2,1,2,3],["Jer",2,18,2,18]]},{"text":"Received proselytes from other nations — Ac 2:10; Ex 12:44,48.","refs":[["Acts",2,10,2,10],["Exod",12,44,12,44],["Exod",12,48,12,48]]},{"text":"Gentiles made one with, under the gospel — Ac 10:15,28; 15:8,9; Ga 3:28; Eph 2:14-16.","refs":[["Acts",10,15,10,15],["Acts",10,28,10,28],["Acts",15,8,15,8],["Acts",15,9,15,9],["Gal",3,28,3,28],["Eph",2,14,2,16]]},{"text":"Envied. — Ne 4:1; Isa 26:11; Eze 35:11.","refs":[["Neh",4,1,4,1],["Isa",26,11,26,11],["Ezek",35,11,35,11]]},{"text":"Hated. — Ps 44:10; Eze 35:5.","refs":[["Ps",44,10,44,10],["Ezek",35,5,35,5]]},{"text":"Oppressed. — Ex 3:9; Jdj 2:18; 4:3.","refs":[["Exod",3,9,3,9],["Judg",2,18,2,18],["Judg",4,3,4,3]]},{"text":"Persecuted. — La 1:3; 5:5.","refs":[["Lam",1,3,1,3],["Lam",5,5,5,5]]},{"text":"Rejoiced at calamities of. — Ps 44:13,14; 80:5,6; Eze 36:4.","refs":[["Ps",44,13,44,13],["Ps",44,14,44,14],["Ps",80,5,80,5],["Ps",80,6,80,6],["Ezek",36,4,36,4]]},{"text":"None hated or oppressed, with impunity — Ps 137:8,9; Eze 25:15,16; 35:6; Ob 1:10-16.","refs":[["Ps",137,8,137,8],["Ps",137,9,137,9],["Ezek",25,15,25,15],["Ezek",25,16,25,16],["Ezek",35,6,35,6],["Obad",1,10,1,16]]},{"text":"Promised to. — Ge 49:10; Da 9:25.","refs":[["Gen",49,10,49,10],["Dan",9,25,9,25]]},{"text":"Expected by. — Ps 14:7; Mt 11:3; Lu 2:25,38; Joh 8:56.","refs":[["Ps",14,7,14,7],["Matt",11,3,11,3],["Luke",2,25,2,25],["Luke",2,38,2,38],["John",8,56,8,56]]},{"text":"Regarded as the restorer of national greatness. — Mt 20:21; Lu 24:21; Ac 1:6.","refs":[["Matt",20,21,20,21],["Luke",24,21,24,21],["Acts",1,6,1,6]]},{"text":"Sprang from. — Ro 9:5; Heb 7:14.","refs":[["Rom",9,5,9,5],["Heb",7,14,7,14]]},{"text":"Rejected by. — Isa 53:3; Mr 6:3; Joh 1:11.","refs":[["Isa",53,3,53,3],["Mark",6,3,6,3],["John",1,11,1,11]]},{"text":"Murdered by. — Ac 7:52; 1Th 2:15.","refs":[["Acts",7,52,7,52],["1Thess",2,15,2,15]]},{"text":"Imprecated the blood of Christ upon themselves and their children — Mt 27:25.","refs":[["Matt",27,25,27,25]]},{"text":"Many of, believed the gospel — Ac 21:20.","refs":[["Acts",21,20,21,20]]},{"text":"Unbelieving, persecuted the Christians — Ac 17:5,13; 1Th 2:14-16.","refs":[["Acts",17,5,17,5],["Acts",17,13,17,13],["1Thess",2,14,2,16]]},{"text":"Cast off for unbelief — Ro 11:17,20.","refs":[["Rom",11,17,11,17],["Rom",11,20